Every native leaf is a named, per-computation axiom, so each one is traceable
to the finite computation that produced it -- e.g.
`a_6._native.native_decide.ax_1_1` is the evaluation of a(6), and
`T_king_3_2._native...` is one cell of the king triangle. There is no blanket
`ofReduceBool` dependency anywhere in the development.

